      },
      "audio": {
        "text": "Wah, manis sekali ya ceritanya! Jangan lupa klik video di layar untuk menonton dongeng seru lainnya, dan klik Subscribe agar kita bisa berpetualang bersama setiap hari! Sampai jumpa di dongeng berikutnya! Dadah!",
        "speakerRole": "narrator",
        "sfxPath": "assets/sfx/sfx_13_outro_pop.m4a",
        "sfxDelaySeconds": 0,
        "en": {
          "text": "What a sweet and comforting bedtime story! Click the video on your screen to enjoy another magical adventure, and don't forget to hit Subscribe so we can keep reading together! See you next time! Bye-bye!",
          "speakerRole": "narrator",
